<title>USA: Thomaston Mills Inc sets qtly divs.</title>
<headline>Thomaston Mills Inc sets qtly divs.</headline>
<dateline>THOMASTON, Ga. 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thomaston Mills Inc said it declared a quarterly dividend on its class A common stock</p>
<p>					Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		 $0.075		    $0.075</p>
<p> Pay		    July 1</p>
<p> Record		June 16</p>
<p>-------</p>
<p>Thomaston Mills Inc also said it declared a quarterly dividend on its class B common stock</p>
<p>					Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		 $0.075		    $0.075</p>
<p> Pay		    July 1</p>
<p> Record		June 16</p>
</text>
